# FEAT-112 source-fetch cache (790MB, contains nested git checkouts)
feat112/.src-cache/

# Review-type docs and outbound comment drafts stay local only (never committed);
# other docs must describe the issue instead of referencing these files (rule 2026-11-23)
feat112/SIT-REVIEW-*.md
feat112/review-*.md
feat112/pr*-comment-*.md
feat112/pr*-correction-*.md
# Issue drafts are tracked as issues in the gitcode repos; local originals only
docs/issues/
